# Denali first customer — full vertical slice

End-to-end proof for the first Denali club on **three apps** with **canonical dev hosts**.

**Smoke club:** `operator` · tenant `00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014`

---

## Host matrix (dev canonical)

| Surface | App | URL |
| ------- | --- | --- |
| Marketing | `apps/marketing` | `http://operator.localhost:3002` |
| Portal | `apps/portal` | `http://operator.portal.localhost:3003` |
| Admin | `apps/web` | `http://operator.admin.localhost:3000` |

Legacy smoke aliases still supported — see [host-subdomain-map.md](p6/runbooks/host-subdomain-map.md).

---

## Vertical slice steps

### VS-01 — Publish active (P6-1)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Admin `operator.admin.localhost:3000` |
| Action | Wizard review → `publishStatus: active` |
| Proof | Draft tour hidden from marketing |

### VS-02 — Marketing lists tour (P6-1)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Marketing `operator.localhost:3002/tours` |
| Proof | Active tour visible in list |

### VS-03 — Portal register success (P6-1)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Portal `operator.portal.localhost:3003/catalog/{tourId}/register` |
| Flow | Phone → OTP (`1234` dev) → profile (if new) → intake |
| Proof | `[data-public-registration-success]` |

### VS-04 — Member `/me` lists row (P6-3)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Portal `/me/registrations` |
| Proof | Registration from VS-03 appears with status |

### VS-05 — Member receipt upload (P6-3)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Portal `/me/registrations/[id]` |
| Action | Upload offline receipt proof |
| Proof | Pending receipt visible to operator |

### VS-06 — Operator approve booking (P6-2)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Admin workspace or bookings command center |
| Action | Approve pending booking from VS-03 |
| Proof | Status `approved` |

Runbook: [first-customer-operator.md](p6/runbooks/first-customer-operator.md)

### VS-07 — Operator approve receipt (P6-2)

| Step | Detail |
| ---- | ------ |
| App | Admin `(app)/finance` |
| Action | Review and approve member receipt |
| Proof | Ledger outbox / finance summary updated |

### VS-08 — P6 gate green (P6-4)

```bash
pnpm run p6:gate
# exits 0 · prints P6_DENALI_PRODUCT_GATE_OK
```

Optional E2E (Architect YES):

```bash
pnpm run p6:e2e-gate
```

